WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.875
Step 7 asks whether this evidence could
pass the test stage's go or no-go.

2
00:00:04.875 --> 00:00:09.250
Every step fails, with the same
reason: no passing live record.

3
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.450
That's on purpose.

4
00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.802
Lab evidence can't promote anything,

5
00:00:12.802 --> 00:00:16.487
so nobody can take a fixture
run to production by mistake.

6
00:00:16.487 --> 00:00:21.470
Step 8 runs this chapter's tests:
ten pass, covering the policy check,

7
00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:26.000
the run folders, the comparison,
the metrics and the evidence.

8
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.490
When you're done, delete
the output folder.
